# Do not put browser-exposed production secrets here.
# Current prototype accepts API keys in the in-app settings panel.
# Recommended next step: move model calls behind a server/API proxy before production.

# "mood hosted" provider — Gemini API key baked into the bundle at build time,
# beta/testing only (anyone with the build can extract it). Copy this file to
# .env.local (gitignored) and set the key to enable the hosted card; when
# unset, hosted shows as unavailable and the app defaults to LM Studio.
# Phase 2 of docs/MONETIZATION.md replaces this with a real proxy + accounts.
VITE_MOOD_HOSTED_KEY=
